# MU Weather needs NO API keys to run — all weather data comes from
# keyless public APIs (Open-Meteo forecast/archive/air-quality, MET Norway,
# MeteoAlarm, NWS). The weather features work completely without this file.
#
# OPTIONAL — AI digest summaries. If you set EXPO_PUBLIC_AI_API_KEY below,
# the daily digest notification is upgraded from the built-in template to a
# short natural-language summary generated by a hosted LLM. Without a key
# (the default) the digest uses the template and nothing else changes.
# ⚠️ EXPO_PUBLIC_* variables are INLINED INTO THE BUILD at bundle time —
# anyone with the APK can extract them. Use a low-limit key, and note that
# the digest only (never raw location history) is sent to the provider.
#
# Provider: anthropic (default) or openai
# EXPO_PUBLIC_AI_PROVIDER=anthropic
# EXPO_PUBLIC_AI_API_KEY=
# EXPO_PUBLIC_AI_MODEL=

# The only variable ever used in CI is the EAS CLI token below.
# It is optional: it is only needed for automated Expo Application Services
# builds (CI). For normal development, run `eas login` instead and you do
# not need this file at all.

EXPO_TOKEN=
